{"product_id":"hot-six-stephanie-plum-no-6-stephanie-plum-novels","title":"Hot Six (Stephanie Plum, No. 6) (Stephanie Plum Novels)","description":"\u003cp\u003eBig-haired bounty hunter Stephanie Plum is back and, boy, has she got man-trouble...First there's fellow bounty hunter Ranger, currently on the run from a murder rap and requesting Stephanie's help. Trouble is she can't decide if she should turn him in or keep him for herself.Then there's sexy vice cop Joe Morelli - the man her heart says she's in love with (even though her head says otherwise). He's after Ranger too - but for less romantic reasons...And now there's another male in her life. He's big, he's orange and he howls when he's left alone.Sexual temptation, homicidal maniacs, car crashes and doughnut addiction are all part of Stephanie Plum's daily routine. But they pale into insignificance when Grandma Mazur moves in...\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 111 x 178\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Janet Evanovich\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780330371247\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 336\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45174670557337,"sku":"5RD9780330371247","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/67bc23265953e_Hot_20Six_20_Stephanie_20Plum_20No._206_20_Stephanie_20Plum_20Novels_20Janet_20Evanovich.jpg?v=1740491416","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/hot-six-stephanie-plum-no-6-stephanie-plum-novels","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}